Use fresh certificate handshakes for verified connections.
The pinned pure-tls ticket cache retains neither peer certificates nor
verification policy; its required-verification path rejects PSK handshakes.
Do not offer cached PSKs in that mode. This also avoids its independently
reproduced binder-length and double-parsing errors, without bypassing checks.

--- a/systems/pure-tls-20260207-8138c76/src/handshake/client.lisp
+++ b/systems/pure-tls-20260207-8138c76/src/handshake/client.lisp
